WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.625
Light bends because the waves slow down in glass.

2
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:08.125
Wave fronts of light come down from the air towards glass.

3
00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:13.000
In glass the waves are slower, so the fronts are closer together.

4
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.225
That bends the direction towards the normal: forty five degrees becomes twenty eight.
